  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a GBFF Project Preparation Grant phase to develop a full project document for the Project &#x2018;Conservation of Biodiversity, its Sustainable Use, Fair and Equitable Sharing of Benefits in India (CONSERVE)&#x2019; , with supporting documentation for submission to the GBFF - GEF for CEO endorsement. The PPG request, submitted by UNDP and World Bank as the GEF Agencies, on behalf of the Government of India, was approved by GEF Secretariat in Dec 2024.</narrative>
